WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.330
A small bakery sells 50 cakes a day.

2
00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:06.000
Every single one finds a buyer.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.560
At 5 pounds 50 each,

4
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.870
that's 275 pounds coming in.

5
00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:12.400
Yet at the end of each day,

6
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.860
the bakery is down 175 pounds.

7
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.780
So if a firm sells thousands of items,

8
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.090
how can it still be losing money?

9
00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.840
In this mission, you'll
work out a firm's costs,

10
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.690
revenue and profit, line by line.

11
00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.550
Then you'll grow the bakery's
output and watch what

12
00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.980
happens to the cost of each cake.

13
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.000
Your mission: find out
where the money goes.
